Spark history server
9) (Opsiyonel) Spark History Server (bitmiş işlerin UI’ı)
Neden? Job bittikten sonra bile geçmişi görmek için.
Event log klasörü:
[veritabaniegitimleri@spark-master ~]$ sudo mkdir -p /var/spark-events
[veritabaniegitimleri@spark-master ~]$ sudo chown -R spark:spark /var/spark-events
[veritabaniegitimleri@spark-master ~]$ sudo su - spark
Last login: Tue Aug 12 09:41:39 UTC 2025 on pts/0


spark-defaults.conf dosyasında gerekli değişiklikler yapılır

[spark@spark-master ~]$ cat <<'EOF' > $SPARK_HOME/conf/spark-defaults.conf
 spark.eventLog.enabled true
 spark.eventLog.dir file:/var/spark-events
 spark.eventLog.compress true
 spark.history.fs.cleaner.enabled true
 spark.history.fs.cleaner.interval 1d
 spark.history.fs.cleaner.maxAge 7d
 EOF

History Server servisleri başlatılır
[spark@spark-master ~]$ SPARK_HISTORY_OPTS="-Dspark.history.fs.logDirectory=file:/var/spark-events \
  -Dspark.history.ui.port=18080 \
  -Dspark.history.fs.update.interval=10s" \
 $SPARK_HOME/sbin/start-history-server.sh
starting org.apache.spark.deploy.history.HistoryServer, logging to /opt/spark/logs/spark-spark-org.apache.spark.deploy.history.HistoryServer-1-spark-master.out
[spark@spark-master ~]$ 

